And in those days John the Baptist came preaching in the wilderness of Judea, saying
And he says: "Repent, for the kingdom of heaven is at hand!"
Isaiah 40:3-5: This is what Isaiah said about him: "A voice cries out: 'In the wilderness prepare the way for the Lord; make straight in the desert a highway for our God.'"
John wore clothing made from camel's hair, was wearing a leather belt, and his food consisted of locusts and wild honey.
