And they confessed their sins, and were baptized in the Jordan River
When he saw many Pharisees and Sadducees coming to where he was baptizing, he said to them: "You brood of vipers! Who warned you to flee from the coming wrath?"
Do things that show what you've learned.
Don't say in your hearts: "We are children of Abraham." I tell you that God can make children for Abraham from these stones.
The axe is now placed on the tree trunks, if a tree doesn't produce good fruit it gets cut down and thrown in the fire.
I baptize you with water for repentance, but he who is coming after me is mightier than I, whose sandals I am not worthy to carry. He will baptize you with the Holy Spirit and fire.
